Oops the renderer early return edit has an issue: `if (!sim.particlesOn.thermal && !sim.particlesOn.intake && !sim.particlesOn.exhaust && heat < 0.02) return;` This is fine. But if thermal off and heat high, we still proceed but heat part gated. Good.

